stages.sampleAnswer:
POST /files/upload
  body: { path, blocks: [{ hash, size }] }
  → 200 { missingBlockHashes: [...] }

PUT /blocks/:hash  (binary body) → 201

GET /files/:id → file metadata + block list
GET /blocks/:hash → binary block

GET /sync?cursor=... → { changes: [...], nextCursor }
WS /sync/subscribe → push 'cursor advanced' notifications.

POST /share { fileId, scope } → { shareUrl }
